          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n.accordion {\n  background-color: #312c2d;\n  color: #E8DFEE;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 20px;\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 0;\n  text-align: left;\n  outline: none;\n  font-size: 25px;\n  transition: 0.4s;\n}\n\n.accordion:after {\n  content: '\\02795'; \/* Unicode character for \"plus\" sign (+) *\/\n  font-size: 25px;\n  color: #E8DFEE;\n  float: right;\n  margin-left: 5px;\n}\n\n.active:after {\n  content: \"\\2796\"; \/* Unicode character for \"minus\" sign (-) *\/\n}\n\n.panel {\n  padding: 18px;\n  display: none;\n  background-color: #231F20;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color:#E8DFEE;\n}\n<\/style>\n\n<h1>How does it work?<\/h1>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">1. Choose problem area<\/button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <p>Using our pinch and hold technique, you apply gentle microcurrent to targeted areas of the face using the probes attached to the Triwave device (The area depends on where you’d like to see results)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">2. Stimulate collagen production<\/button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <p>This gentle microcurrent mimics the body’s natural current and stimulates the facial muscles, cell growth and collagen production in the Dermal layer of your skin.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">3. Maintain a youthful appearance<\/button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <p>Regular stimulation, improved cell growth and higher collagen production leads to evened out facial muscles and connective tissue, ultimately minimizing fine lines and wrinkles, lifting sagging areas and giving you a more youthful appearance. \n<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<script>\nvar acc = document.getElementsByClassName(\"accordion\");\nvar i;\n\nfor (i = 0; i < acc.length; i++) {\n  acc[i].addEventListener(\"click\", function() {\n    this.classList.toggle(\"active\");\n    var panel = this.nextElementSibling;\n    if (panel.style.display === \"block\") {\n      panel.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      panel.style.display = \"block\";\n    }\n  });\n}\n<\/script>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "top-middle"
          }
        }
      },
